# Build context for the `api` and `pipeline` images (context = solution/).
# `web` has its own web/.dockerignore; `docs` uses the submission-root .dockerignore.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/site
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
.git
# Runtime data: the pipeline regenerates bronze/silver/gold; feedback is user data mounted at runtime.
data/bronze
data/silver
data/gold/opportunity_features
data/gold/history_stats
data/gold/labels
data/feedback
spark-warehouse
derby.log
metastore_db
# Secrets and local-only files, at any depth.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.local
**/.private
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/settings.local.json
**/kaggle.json
**/credentials.json
